WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:08.590
Check who can do what, confirm or remove access person by person, and switch off dormant accounts.

2
00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:15.880
Once a quarter, check who can do what. The access review puts it all on one page.

3
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:24.850
At the top: how many people are reviewed this quarter, powerful rights, dormant accounts and changes in the last 30 days.

4
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:33.420
Everyone against every module: each square is a person's level in a module. The darker, the more they can do.

5
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:40.820
Certify this quarter: for each person, keep their access, mark it for a change, or remove it.

6
00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:49.120
Add a note where it helps.

7
00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:57.310
Save the review. It is kept with the date and your name, ready for the auditors.

8
00:00:57.310 --> 00:01:05.290
Dormant accounts have not signed in for a long time. Tick them and switch them off together.

9
00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:12.360
Powerful rights lists who can manage users, grant access or export data, so nothing slips through.

10
00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:16.640
Export the review as a spreadsheet for your records.
